        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Help Seeking Among Undergraduate Men and Women in Engineering</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 600px;\n      min-height: 450px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    header {\n      height: 64px;\n      padding: 12px 7px 5px;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #090d22;\n    }\n    header h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      line-height: 22px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .authors {\n      margin-top: 3px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 12px;\n    }\n    .affiliations {\n      font-size: 8px;\n      line-height: 9px;\n    }\n    .columns {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n      height: 386px;\n    }\n    .column {\n      padding: 7px 8px 3px;\n      font-size: 8.45px;\n      line-height: 10.7px;\n      border-right: 1px solid #e7e7e7;\n    }\n    .column:last-child { border-right: 0; }\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 5px;\n      color: #4a9b77;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 12px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n    h3 {\n      margin: 8px 0 3px;\n      color: #4a9b77;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 11px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n    }\n    strong { font-weight: 700; }\n    .quote {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 3px 5px 8px 10px;\n      padding: 1px 4px 1px 5px;\n      color: #777;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 13px;\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .quote:before {\n      content: \"“\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -9px;\n      top: -4px;\n      color: #d6d83a;\n      font-family: Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      font-style: normal;\n      line-height: 24px;\n    }\n    .quote:after {\n      content: \"”\";\n      position: absolute;\n      right: -5px;\n      bottom: -10px;\n      color: #d6d83a;\n      font-family: Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      font-style: normal;\n      line-height: 24px;\n    }\n    .chart {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 154px;\n      height: 92px;\n      margin: 4px auto 9px;\n      padding: 9px 4px 14px 40px;\n      border-left: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to right,\n          transparent 0,\n          transparent 28px,\n          #eeeeee 29px,\n          transparent 30px\n        );\n    }\n    .chart-caption {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      top: -9px;\n      font-size: 4.1px;\n      line-height: 5px;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .bar-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      height: 12px;\n      font-size: 4.2px;\n      line-height: 5px;\n    }\n    .bar-label {\n      width: 38px;\n      margin-left: -40px;\n      padding-right: 3px;\n      text-align: right;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .bar {\n      height: 5px;\n      background: #858585;\n      border-right: 1px solid #676767;\n    }\n    .axis {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 40px;\n      right: 2px;\n      bottom: 2px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #777;\n      font-size: 4px;\n    }\n    .chart.placeholder .placeholder-caption {\n      display: none;\n    }\n    .column-chart {\n      width: 162px;\n      height: 102px;\n      margin: 3px auto 7px;\n      position: relative;\n      border-left: 1px solid #aaa;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to top,\n          transparent 0,\n          transparent 19px,\n          #ededed 20px,\n          transparent 21px\n        );\n    }\n    .column-chart .chart-title {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -13px;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      font-size: 5px;\n      line-height: 6px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .column-chart .y-labels {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -15px;\n      top: 0;\n      height: 92px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      font-size: 4px;\n      color: #666;\n    }\n    .columns-area {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 28px;\n      right: 8px;\n      bottom: 0;\n      height: 87px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-around;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n    }\n    .column-bar-wrap {\n      height: 100%;\n      width: 42px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      font-size: 5px;\n    }\n    .column-bar {\n      width: 32px;\n      background: #399955;\n    }\n    .column-name {\n      margin-top: 3px;\n      font-size: 5px;\n    }\n    .nsf {\n      width: 43px;\n      height: 43px;\n      float: right;\n      margin: 1px 0 0 5px;\n      border: 2px solid #a89954;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #1d4f65;\n      font-family: Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 38px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .nsf:after {\n      content: \"★\";\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: -17px;\n      color: #a89954;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    .fine {\n      font-size: 7.6px;\n      line-height: 9.3px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Help Seeking Among Undergraduate Men and Women in Engineering</h1>\n      <div class=\"authors\">J.W.J.<sup>1</sup>, J.F.<sup>1</sup>, E.P.<sup>2</sup>, and S.K.<sup>1</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"affiliations\"><sup>1</sup>Carnegie Mellon University, <sup>2</sup>Tennessee Tech University</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"columns\">\n      <article class=\"column\">\n        <h2>Asking for help fosters student success</h2>\n        <p>Asking for help when necessary is critical to success in the workplace, but newcomers often fear how they will be perceived when they request assistance.</p>\n        <p>Understanding factors that motivate or inhibit various groups of students from seeking help can help us understand how to <strong>design interventions that will foster student success.</strong></p>\n\n        <div class=\"quote\">Most of the time I'm very hesitant to go to their office. I do it, but I'm always scared that they're gonna think I'm an idiot when I walk back out.</div>\n\n        <h3>Women experience concern about how they are perceived when seeking help</h3>\n        <p>We interviewed 47 engineering undergraduates about their help-seeking strategies: <strong>32 women</strong> and <strong>15 men.</strong></p>\n\n        <div class=\"column-chart placeholder\" aria-label=\"Chart: respondents reported fear of being perceived as unintelligent or unprepared\">\n          <div class=\"chart-title\">Respondents Reported Fear of Being Perceived<br>as Unintelligent or Unprepared</div>\n          <div class=\"y-labels\"><span>80%</span><span>60%</span><span>40%</span><span>20%</span><span>0%</span></div>\n          <div class=\"columns-area\">\n            <div class=\"column-bar-wrap\">\n              <div class=\"column-bar\" style=\"height: 29px;\"></div>\n              <div class=\"column-name\">Men</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"column-bar-wrap\">\n              <div class=\"column-bar\" style=\"height: 65px;\"></div>\n              <div class=\"column-name\">Women</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Chart: bottom-left]</span>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"column\">\n        <h2>Women report reaching out to more<br>resources than men</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"chart placeholder\" aria-label=\"Chart: resources used\">\n          <div class=\"chart-caption\">Number of Resources</div>\n          <div class=\"bar-row\"><span class=\"bar-label\">Tutoring</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"width: 22px;\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-row\"><span class=\"bar-label\">Faculty</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"width: 50px;\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-row\"><span class=\"bar-label\">Teaching Assistants</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"width: 79px;\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-row\"><span class=\"bar-label\">Peers</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"width: 145px;\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-row\"><span class=\"bar-label\">Online</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"width: 130px;\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"bar-row\"><span class=\"bar-label\">Professors</span><span class=\"bar\" style=\"width: 117px;\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"axis\"><span>0</span><span>20</span><span>40</span><span>60</span><span>80</span></div>\n          <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Chart: centered]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p><strong>Over 90% of women reported using two or more resources compared to less than half the men.</strong></p>\n        <p><strong>Nearly 30% (n=14)</strong> of the students we interviewed stated a strong preference to figure problems out themselves.</p>\n        <p>This sentiment was more commonly expressed by male students <strong>(40%)</strong> than female students <strong>(25%).</strong></p>\n        <p>For some of our students, this independence manifested as a source of pride that prevented them from seeking help.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"quote\">I see most of the students are boys and they are very—I don't know, maybe they get it better than I do. Sometimes I'll feel maybe embarrassed to ask them questions</div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"column\">\n        <h2>Positive experiences encourage students<br>to ask for help</h2>\n        <p>Many students reported feeling more comfortable after a positive experience with an instructor who reached out to them, <strong>encouraged them, or expressed a clear passion for teaching.</strong></p>\n        <p>Students reported developing strategies for asking questions. Most commonly doing as much of the work as possible in advance in order to form <strong>specific questions.</strong></p>\n\n        <div class=\"quote\">I try to do all the work beforehand, so I can point out to him exactly what's going wrong, and why I'm not understanding</div>\n\n        <h3>Seeking help should be framed as an academic competency</h3>\n        <div class=\"nsf placeholder\" aria-label=\"Logo: NSF\">NSF</div>\n        <p>Students need to be persuaded that when to ask for help and how to ask competently are valued life-long skills.</p>\n        <p>If students perceive asking for help effectively as an engineering competency, we can engage other marginalized students for asking questions.</p>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
